.IX Title "LR_XML2REPORT.IN 1"
.TH LR_XML2REPORT.IN 1 2025-09-28 "Lire 2.1.1" "LogReport's Lire Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
