.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lr_xml2report \- Format a XML report to the appropriate output format
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBlr_xml2report\fR \fB[\fR\fIoptions\fR\fB]\fR \fB[\fR\fIreport_file\fR\fB]\fR \fB[\fR\fIoutput_file\fR\fB]\fR
.PP
\&\fBlr_xml2report\fR \fB\-\-version\fR
.PP
\&\fBlr_xml2report\fR \fB\-\-help\fR \fB[dlf\-converters|output\-formats|report\-templates]\fR
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP "\fB\-\-help\fR \fB[\fR\fIsection\fR\fB]\fR" 4
.IX Item "--help [section]"
If no argument is given, prints usage information and exits. Argument
can be one of the following:
.RS 4
.IP dlf\-converters 4
.IX Item "dlf-converters"
Prints the list of available DLF converters and exits.
.IP output\-formats 4
.IX Item "output-formats"
Prints the list of available output formats and exits.
.IP report\-templates 4
.IX Item "report-templates"
Prints the list of available report templates and exits.
.RE
.RS 4
.RE
.IP "\fB\-\-output\-format\fR \fIoutput format\fR" 4
.IX Item "--output-format output format"
Selects the ouput format in which to generate the report.
.IP "\fB\-\-template\fR \fIname\fR" 4
.IX Item "--template name"
Uses the report configuration template named \fIname\fR to merge the
reports. This option is required when using the \fB\-\-merge\fR option to
merge reports.
.IP "\fB\-\-merge\fR \fIreport_file\fR" 4
.IX Item "--merge report_file"
Merge \fIreport_file\fR before formatting the report. This option can be
used multiple times to merge more than two reports.
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBlr_xml2report\fR converts the XML reports generated by Lire to various
output format.
.PP
The script could be run as e.g.
.PP
.Vb 2
\& lr_xml2report \-\-output\-format pdf \-\-template print_default \e
\&   \-\-merge report.2.xml \-\-merge report.1.xmlreport.3.xml > report.pdf
.Ve
.PP
(in multiple XML input files mode) or as
.PP
run lr_xml2report \-\-output\-format txt report.xml report.txt
.PP
(in single XML input file mode).
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBlr_log2mail\fR\|(1), \fBlr_log2report\fR\|(1), \fBlr_xml2mail\fR\|(1), \fBlire\fR\|(1), \fBlire\fR\|(7),
documentation in the Lire User Manual
